# Build-context filter for labs/27-deployment/app/Dockerfile (context = repo root).
# An ALLOWLIST: exclude everything, then re-include only what the image needs.
# A new file in the repo (a dump, a notebook, a key) stays out unless someone adds it here.
*

!llmkit/
!mockllm/
!labs/27-deployment/app/pyproject.toml
!labs/27-deployment/app/uv.lock
!labs/27-deployment/app/service/

# Re-excluded inside the allowed folders. Order matters: the LAST matching line wins,
# so these must come after the ! lines above.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.git
**/.venv
**/.env
**/.env.*
